(she needed resistance from fire and was munching on a red dragon).

All she had for decent equipment was +2 blessed longsword named Excaliber,
cursed ring of conflict (being worn) and enough cursed armor to be AC-7. 
Intrinsics included teleport (I had no teleport control, tho), cold, posion,
shock resistance.  Phido got himself killed on Dlvl 2 by falling into a pit. 
Next pet met a cockatrice.  I had a pet Ettin when I died (I thought it was a
large dog when I got it.  The joy of polymorphing).

Ah well, she was the best character I had going too.

